# Original engineering rows; add is supplied by build_support.py.
add('b171','箱涵頂進的力鏈、地層損失與營運界面~Box-jacking load paths, ground loss and operating interfaces','矩形箱涵需按框架與施工階段分析；簡支條帶、摩擦與體積模型只分離個別機制，不代替完整設計。~Rectangular boxes require frame and construction-stage analysis; simple strips, friction and volume models isolate mechanisms rather than constitute a complete design.','假設摩擦係數從 0.15 增至 0.25，自重 5760 kN 對應的底面摩擦由 864 增至 1440 kN；未含側摩阻及切口阻力。~Increasing assumed friction from 0.15 to 0.25 raises base friction for 5760 kN weight from 864 to 1440 kN, excluding side friction and cutting resistance.',r'''
箱涵自重與滑移界面~Box weight and sliding interfaces§箱涵混凝土截面由外框扣除內孔得到，但附屬設備、臨時構件與積水仍需另計。自重決定底面接觸的部分法向力，浮力和地層反力則會改變分布；把外包體積全部視為實心會高估重量並扭曲推力預估。~Subtract the internal void from the outer rectangle to obtain concrete area, while accounting separately for equipment, temporary works and water. Weight contributes to base normal force, modified by buoyancy and soil reactions. Treating the bounding volume as solid overstates mass and distorts thrust estimates.§Ac=8 m*5 m-7 m*4 m=12 m2; W=24 kN/m3*12 m2*20 m=5760 kN§逐項核對外內尺寸、附加重量及底面實際接觸區~Reconcile outer and inner dimensions, additional weight and actual base contact zones§錯把中空箱涵當實心，造成重量與摩阻模型系統偏差~Treating a hollow box as solid biases weight and friction models systematically§箱涵外框長寬高相乘就等於全部混凝土體積~Multiplying outer box dimensions gives the total concrete volume
油壓推力與後座反力~Hydraulic thrust and reaction-wall force§千斤頂壓力透過有效活塞面積變成力，後座牆和地層必須提供相反反力。油封摩擦、回油壓及不同缸位使表壓總和不是精確合力；推力能力與後座可承力是不同限制，不能因油壓未滿就判斷可繼續增加負載。~Jack pressure produces force over effective piston area, requiring equal reaction from the thrust wall and ground. Seal friction, return pressure and cylinder states affect the result. Hydraulic capability and reaction-wall capacity are separate constraints; unused pressure capacity does not establish permission to increase load.§idealThrust=p*A=25 MPa*0.12 m2=3.0 MN§比對有效缸面積、校正荷重與後座位移及裂縫~Compare effective piston area, calibrated load and reaction-wall displacement and cracks§後座地層先變形，油壓增加只擴大後退而非有效前進~Reaction ground deforms first and increased pressure causes retreat rather than useful advance§千斤頂額定推力就是後座地層必然能承受的推力~Rated jack thrust is automatically the thrust the reaction ground can sustain
底面摩擦與潤滑變異~Base friction and lubrication variability§滑移界面摩阻隨有效法向力、材料接觸與潤滑狀態改變，啟動阻力可能高於穩定滑移。庫倫模型只表示一個假設狀態，不能把同一係數套到乾濕區、停機時間及側面土壓；推力歷程需按工況分段解讀。~Sliding friction depends on effective normal force, contact materials and lubrication, with breakaway potentially above steady motion. A Coulomb model describes an assumed state, not one coefficient valid across dry zones, waiting periods and side earth pressure. Interpret thrust histories by operating condition.§baseFriction=mu*W=0.15*5760 kN=864 kN§比較啟動與穩態推力、停機時長及潤滑覆蓋證據~Compare breakaway and steady thrust, stoppage duration and lubrication coverage evidence§局部失潤滑造成推力尖峰，被誤判成全面硬地層~Local lubrication loss creates a thrust spike mistaken for uniformly hard ground§量到一次低摩擦係數就可套用所有後續頂進階段~One low measured friction coefficient applies to every later jacking stage
頂板框架與施工支承~Roof-frame action and construction support§箱涵頂板和側牆形成框架，角部轉動限制使彎矩不同於獨立簡支梁。條帶模型可用來核對量級，但頂進時前緣懸伸、地面交通與覆土拱效應又改變支承；應逐階段標出荷載路徑和拉力側。~The roof and walls form a frame, with corner restraint changing moments from those of an isolated simple beam. A strip check estimates scale only; front overhang, surface traffic and soil arching alter support during jacking. Identify load paths and tension faces separately for each stage.§idealStripMoment=q*L^2/8=50 kN/m*(7 m)^2/8=306.25 kNm for a 1 m strip§將框架邊界、頂板應變及前緣懸伸狀態共同比對~Compare frame restraints, roof strains and leading-edge overhang state§把固定角部當鉸接，遺漏角隅負彎矩與裂縫需求~Treating restrained corners as hinges misses negative corner moment and cracking demand§頂板當作簡支梁計算就涵蓋所有框架受力~A simple-beam roof calculation covers every frame action
刃口接觸與局部承壓~Cutting-edge contact and local bearing§刃口將前緣阻力傳入箱涵，局部硬塊和偏斜會縮小實際接觸面。平均壓力不能代表刃角峰值，背後混凝土還需承受剪力與劈裂；不均勻切削也可能改變行進方向，應把局部受力和姿態聯合判讀。~The cutting edge transfers face resistance into the box, while hard inclusions and skew reduce active contact area. Mean pressure misses corner peaks and the backing concrete must resist shear and splitting. Uneven cutting can also steer the box, linking local load evidence with attitude monitoring.§averageContact=600 kN/2 m2=300 kPa§比較刃口磨耗、分區推力與前端姿態變化~Compare edge wear, zonal thrust and leading-end attitude changes§一側硬塊集中受力使刃口局部損傷並帶偏箱涵~A hard inclusion concentrates force on one side, damaging the edge and steering the box§刃口總面積夠大就不會產生任何局部壓碎~A sufficiently large total edge area prevents every local crushing mechanism
推力偏心與箱身應力~Eccentric thrust and box stress§推力中心偏離承壓截面中心會同時引入軸壓與彎曲，局部頂塊接觸也不必均勻。線彈性疊加只適用未開裂及已知截面幾何，不能替代箱涵角部和開孔分析；多缸推力應與實際力臂一起核對。~Thrust eccentricity combines compression and bending, and thrust-block contact need not be uniform. Linear superposition requires an uncracked section with known properties and cannot replace corner or opening analysis. Reconcile individual jack forces with their actual lever arms rather than summing magnitudes alone.§M=3000 kN*0.05 m=150 kNm; sigmaMax=N/A+M/Z=3000/1+150/0.2=3750 kPa (A=1 m2,Z=0.2 m3)§核對各缸荷重與力臂，對照箱身兩側應變~Check individual jack loads and arms against opposite-side box strains§總推力正常但分配偏心，箱身一側裂縫持續擴大~Normal total thrust conceals eccentric distribution and growing cracks on one side§只要總推力沒超限就不用關心各千斤頂分配~If total thrust stays below its limit jack-force distribution does not matter
姿態修正與曲線相容~Attitude correction and path compatibility§箱涵姿態由前後位置共同決定，短距偏移不等於沿全長均勻轉角。剛體小角度可識別量級，實際修正受地層、導板與框架變形限制；突然集中修正可能增加側壓和摩阻，不能把幾何誤差直接轉為操作命令。~Front and rear positions jointly determine box attitude, and a local offset is not uniform rotation along the whole length. Small-angle geometry estimates scale, while soil, guides and frame deformation constrain correction. Concentrated correction can increase lateral pressure and friction, so geometric error is not an operating command.§smallAngle=offset/baseline=0.040 m/20 m=0.002 rad§以共同基準比較前後測點與導板接觸痕跡~Compare front and rear survey points and guide-contact marks in a common datum§單點修正造成尾部擠壓，前端改善但全體摩阻上升~Single-point correction pinches the rear, improving the front while raising overall friction§前端位置回到線上就代表整個箱涵姿態正確~A leading end back on line proves the entire box attitude is correct
超挖體積與地層損失~Overbreak volume and ground loss§箱體周邊超挖、面前流失與潤滑空隙閉合都可能造成地表位移，土量平衡須區分原位和鬆方體積。簡化損失比例不能直接給出某建物沉陷，因為傳播受埋深及地層影響；應連結出土、間隙與地面監測。~Overbreak, face loss and closure of lubricated gaps can all move the ground; volume balance must distinguish in-situ and loose spoil. A loss fraction does not directly predict a particular building settlement because depth and geology control propagation. Connect spoil, gap and surface monitoring records.§excavatedPrism=40 m2*20 m=800 m3; assumedLoss=0.005*800 m3=4 m3§將原位換算出土量、周邊間隙及地表沉陷按里程對齊~Align in-situ-equivalent spoil, peripheral gaps and surface settlement by chainage§鬆方出土量未換算就與原位相比，掩蓋實際地層流失~Comparing loose spoil directly with in-situ volume conceals real ground loss§超挖百分比可以直接當作地表最大沉陷百分比~An overbreak percentage directly equals the maximum surface-settlement percentage
鐵路介面與差異沉陷~Rail interface and differential settlement§跨越營運線時，軌道幾何關心相鄰點的差異及變化速度，而非只有平均沉陷。兩點沉陷差除距離僅為平均沉陷坡度，仍含整體剛體傾斜；不能直接當作已扣除傾斜的角變形或規範軌道扭曲，也不能取代道床支承和營運標準；監測需分開頂進、回填與恢復交通後的再壓密。~Operating rail interfaces depend on differential movement and rate, not mean settlement alone. Settlement difference over distance is a mean settlement slope that still includes rigid-body tilt. It is not automatically tilt-corrected angular distortion or code-defined track twist and does not replace ballast-support or operating criteria. Distinguish jacking, backfill and post-reopening densification when interpreting monitoring histories.§meanSettlementSlope=8 mm/10000 mm=0.0008 rad; rigid-body tilt has not been removed and this is not track twist§比較兩軌高程、相鄰測點差及恢復交通後趨勢~Compare both rail elevations, neighboring differences and post-reopening trends§平均沉陷小但局部差異大，軌道幾何仍不符合營運需求~Small mean settlement conceals local differentials that compromise required track geometry§平均沉陷足夠小就代表所有鐵路幾何必定合格~Sufficiently small average settlement guarantees all railway geometry is acceptable
封鎖窗口與恢復證據~Possession windows and restoration evidence§施工窗口需容納頂進、檢查、回填和系統恢復，工序之間的相依不能以單一速度估算取代。剩餘時間只顯示排程餘裕，並不是遇到異常可壓縮驗證的理由；放行資料必須能追溯到最後實際構形。~A possession window includes jacking, inspection, backfill and system restoration, with dependencies beyond a single advance rate. Remaining time indicates schedule reserve and does not justify compressing verification after an anomaly. Release evidence must trace to the final actual configuration rather than the planned one.§timeReserve=720 min-600 min=120 min; reserveFraction=120/720=16.7 percent§核對相依工序實際時間與恢復後的檢查簽認~Reconcile dependent activities with actual times and post-restoration inspection signoffs§為追趕窗口跳過恢復檢查，留下未驗證的軌道或回填狀態~Skipping restoration checks to recover time leaves track or backfill condition unverified§窗口還有剩餘時間就代表工程品質已經獲得保證~Remaining possession time proves construction quality has already been assured
''')

add('b172','微型隧道的面壓、泥水輸送與管節受力~Microtunnel face pressure, slurry transport and pipe loading','泥水壓力、土體應力和管節結構採不同邊界；簡化水力及平均承壓均不能直接設定設備參數。~Slurry pressure, ground stress and pipe structure use distinct boundaries; simplified hydraulics and average bearing cannot directly set equipment parameters.','假定推力 1200 kN 不變，有效接觸面從 0.30 減到 0.15 m2 時，平均接頭承壓由 4 增至 8 MPa；局部峰值可能更高。~At an assumed 1200 kN thrust, reducing effective contact from 0.30 to 0.15 m2 doubles mean joint bearing from 4 to 8 MPa; local peaks may be higher.',r'''
面壓合力與地下水邊界~Face-pressure resultant and groundwater boundary§泥水面壓需與土骨架及孔隙水的穩定條件共同評估，壓力乘圓面積只是作用合力。高程差使掌子面上下水壓不同，局部滲透又影響有效應力；不能將這個合力當成面前土體所需支護的完整判準。~Slurry face pressure must be assessed with soil-skeleton and pore-water stability; pressure times circular area is only a resultant. Elevation creates vertical pressure variation and seepage changes effective stress. This resultant alone does not establish the support needed for the ground ahead of the machine.§uniformResultant=250 kPa*pi*(1.5 m)^2/4=441.8 kN§將艙壓感測高程、地下水頭及地層剖面對應~Relate chamber-pressure sensor elevation to groundwater head and ground profile§使用不同高程壓力直接比較，誤判面前支護裕度~Comparing pressures at different elevations directly misjudges face-support margin§泥水壓力乘面積就是完整的掌子面穩定驗算~Slurry pressure times area constitutes a complete face-stability verification
泥漿濃度與固體平衡~Slurry concentration and solids balance§回流密度同時受輸入載液、挖出固體及混入水影響，需用兩相質量體積平衡估固體濃度。輸入載液若已有固體就不能把全部回流固體當新增出土；沉積與密度計偏差也會使瞬時資料不能閉合長時段土量。~Return density depends on carrier fluid, excavated solids and incoming water, requiring two-phase balance. Solids already present in the feed cannot be counted as newly excavated ground. Deposition and density-meter bias further prevent instantaneous readings from closing a long-period excavation balance.§Inputs densities rhoMix=1300, rhoCarrier=1100, rhoSolid=2650 kg/m3; Cv=(rhoMix-rhoCarrier)/(rhoSolid-rhoCarrier)=(1300-1100)/(2650-1100)=0.1290; Qs=0.050 m3/s*Cv=0.00645 m3/s§同步比較進回流密度、流量與分離固體質量~Compare synchronized feed and return density, flow and separated-solids mass§循環載液原有固體被重複計為出土，造成虛假超挖警訊~Recirculated carrier solids are counted again as excavation and create a false overbreak signal§回流所有固體都一定是這一時段新挖出的土~Every solid in the return flow was newly excavated during that interval
開挖體積與進尺一致性~Excavated volume and advance consistency§理論切削體積由切削外徑及實際進尺決定，並非成品管內徑。超挖與面前土體流入會使移除量增加，而含水、膨鬆及分離滯留使地面量測不直接等於原位量；應保留體積換算及輸送延遲。~Theoretical cut volume uses cutter diameter and actual advance rather than finished internal diameter. Overcut and face inflow increase removal, while moisture, bulking and separator retention alter surface measurements. Preserve conversion assumptions and transport delay when reconciling excavated volume with progress.§theoreticalVolume=pi*(1.5 m)^2/4*0.50 m=0.8836 m3§將刀盤外徑、進尺時戳與延遲修正出土量比對~Compare cutter diameter and advance timestamps with delay-corrected spoil volume§忽略回流延遲把前段出土誤配後段進尺，掩蓋局部流失~Ignoring return delay assigns earlier spoil to later advance and hides local loss§成品管內徑可以直接用來計算刀盤開挖體積~Finished pipe internal diameter directly gives the cutter excavation volume
管壁摩阻與長度累積~Pipe skin friction and length accumulation§管列軸力沿長度累積，摩阻取決於地層接觸、潤滑與有效應力，前端還有切削與面壓阻力。均勻剪應力模型僅可看長度敏感度，接頭錯位和停機黏著可能使局部阻力突升；總推力不能直接反推唯一摩阻值。~Axial pipe force accumulates along the drive, with friction controlled by contact, lubrication and effective stress in addition to front resistance. Uniform shear illustrates length sensitivity only. Misalignment and stoppage adhesion can create local increases, so total thrust does not identify a unique friction value.§skinResistance=tau*pi*D*L=5 kPa*pi*1.5 m*100 m=2356 kN§對照各段推力增量、潤滑紀錄與停機時間~Compare thrust increments by segment with lubrication records and stoppage duration§摩阻集中在局部失潤滑段，均勻模型低估該處管節負荷~Friction concentrates in a poorly lubricated section and a uniform model understates local pipe loading§把總推力除以全管外表面就得到真實均勻摩阻~Dividing total thrust by pipe surface yields the true uniform skin friction
接頭傳力與墊材接觸~Joint load transfer and packer contact§頂管接頭透過端面與墊材傳遞壓力，曲線、偏轉和端面不平會縮小有效接觸面。墊材壓縮改變接觸分布而非只平均分力；平均承壓偏低仍可能發生邊緣剝落，需與接頭角差及材料壓縮特性一起檢查。~Pipe joints transmit thrust through end faces and packers, while curvature, deflection and unevenness reduce effective contact. Packer compression redistributes contact rather than merely averaging force. Low mean stress can coexist with edge spalling, requiring checks against joint angle and packer compression characteristics.§jointBearing=1200 kN/0.30 m2=4000 kPa=4 MPa§比較接頭角差、墊材壓痕及管端裂縫位置~Compare joint angularity, packer impressions and pipe-end crack locations§接頭一側失去接觸使另一側壓碎，總推力仍低於名義額定~Loss of contact on one side crushes the opposite edge despite thrust below the nominal rating§總推力低於管節額定值就不需檢查接頭接觸~Thrust below the pipe rating eliminates the need to inspect joint contact
雷射坡度與基準傳遞~Laser grade and datum transfer§重力管線的坡度依賴長距高程一致性，雷射線、機頭姿態及管列中心線是不同量。折射、支架位移和發射點重設會造成共同偏差，不能靠同一儀器重複讀值排除；接收井閉合與獨立水準可提供外部檢核。~Gravity pipelines depend on consistent elevation over distance; laser line, machine attitude and pipe centerline differ. Refraction, mount movement and transmitter resets introduce shared bias that repeated readings cannot remove. Receiving-shaft closure and independent leveling provide external checks on the transferred datum.§gradeDrop=slope*length=0.003*100 m=0.30 m§核對雷射基準、獨立水準及管底實測高程~Check laser reference, independent leveling and measured pipe-invert elevation§發射架位移使整段同向偏移，機內導向仍顯示接近目標~Transmitter-mount movement shifts a whole drive while onboard guidance still reports near-target position§雷射讀值穩定就能證明整條管線高程沒有偏差~Stable laser readings prove the entire pipeline elevation has no bias
泥水管路損失與流變~Slurry-line loss and rheology§輸送管的壓損受流速、管徑、彎頭及泥漿流變影響，清水形式的摩擦係數不能任意套用高濃度漿體。等效牛頓流體算例只是量級比較，沉積還會改變有效管徑；泵端壓力不能代表機頭艙壓。~Transport losses depend on velocity, diameter, fittings and slurry rheology; a water friction factor cannot be assumed for concentrated slurry. An equivalent-Newtonian example is a scale check, while deposition changes effective diameter. Pump discharge pressure does not directly represent face-chamber pressure.§dp=f*(L/D)*rho*v^2/2=0.03*(200 m/0.15 m)*1200 kg/m3*(2 m/s)^2/2=96000 Pa§比較管路分段壓差、流量與泥漿流變及沉積檢查~Compare sectional pressure loss, flow and slurry rheology with deposition checks§把泵壓上升當成面壓增加，漏掉管內堵塞與輸送衰退~Treating rising pump pressure as rising face pressure misses blockage and reduced transport§泵出口壓力一定等於掌子面泥水艙壓力~Pump discharge pressure always equals slurry pressure at the excavation face
地表槽形與體積推估~Surface troughs and volume estimates§橫向沉陷槽積分可估每延米地表體積損失，但槽寬、最大沉陷與基準誤差需共同擬合。高斯形只是特定土層情境的近似，建物、地下水和多管線互動可破壞對稱；地表損失也不必等於當時出土超量。~Integrating a transverse settlement trough estimates surface volume loss per unit length, requiring joint assessment of width, peak and datum error. A Gaussian is an approximation for particular ground conditions; buildings, groundwater and adjacent drives can break symmetry. Surface loss need not equal contemporaneous excess spoil.§Vs=sqrt(2*pi)*i*Smax=2.5066*4 m*0.003 m=0.0301 m2§用橫向測線殘差與長期基準點穩定性檢驗槽形~Test the trough fit against transverse residuals and stable long-term benchmarks§只量中心點就套固定槽寬，錯估受影響區域與體積損失~Measuring only the center and imposing a fixed width misestimates affected area and volume loss§單一最大沉陷讀值足以唯一決定完整沉陷槽形~One maximum-settlement reading uniquely determines the complete trough shape
接收井水壓與破口界面~Receiving-shaft pressure and opening interfaces§機頭到達接收井時，土體及井壁的水密邊界會改變，開口的水壓合力需用對應水頭計算。井內外水位、封口和地層滲透共同決定流動風險；靜水力算例不能代替經核定的接收與隔離設計。~Arrival changes groundwater boundaries at the shaft wall and ground interface; calculate opening force using the relevant head. Internal and external levels, seals and permeability jointly determine inflow risk. A hydrostatic force example does not replace an approved reception and isolation design.§waterForce=rho*g*h*A=1000 kg/m3*9.81 m/s2*12 m*1.5 m2=176580 N=176.6 kN§將接收開口高程、內外水位及封口試驗資料對齊~Align receiving-opening elevation, internal and external levels and seal-test evidence§接收前水位升高未更新壓差，原有封口假設失效~A pre-arrival water-level rise invalidates the pressure difference assumed for the seal§機頭到達接收井就代表地下水風險自動消失~Groundwater risk automatically disappears once the machine reaches the receiving shaft
成品管線水密與紀錄~Finished-pipeline tightness and records§完成頂進後的接頭水密與施工時抗推力是兩種性能，局部擦傷或墊圈位移可能未在推力曲線顯現。流量試驗需聲明測段、水頭及穩定時間，並區分管體、接頭和端部封堵；全線平均值不能掩蓋關鍵局部漏點。~Post-jacking joint tightness differs from thrust resistance, and damaged or displaced seals may leave no clear thrust signature. Flow tests need defined section, head and stabilization time and must distinguish pipes, joints and end closures. An overall average cannot conceal critical localized leakage.§measuredLeakage=12 L/30 min=0.40 L/min at a specified hypothetical test head§核對試驗水頭、測段界線與逐接頭影像紀錄~Check test head, section boundaries and images indexed to individual joints§端部試驗封堵漏水被誤判管線失效，或局部漏點被全線平均隱藏~A leaking test closure is mistaken for pipe failure or overall averaging hides a local leak§頂進推力曲線平順就代表完工管線必定完全水密~A smooth jacking-thrust history guarantees a fully watertight finished pipeline
''')

add('b173','頂管中繼站的分段受力、行程相容與局部接觸~Intermediate-jacking segment forces, stroke compatibility and local contact','中繼站重分配管列推力而不創造免反力推進；靜態分段模型未包含設備同步、地層非線性及動態衝擊。~Intermediate stations redistribute pipeline thrust rather than provide reaction-free advance; static segment models omit synchronization, nonlinear ground response and dynamic impact.','若同壓八缸其中一缸無有效輸出，理想合力由 1.6 降至 1.4 MN，還會改變合力位置；不能只按八分之七評估安全。~Losing one effective cylinder from eight equal-pressure cylinders reduces ideal resultant from 1.6 to 1.4 MN and shifts its location; a seven-eighths capacity ratio alone cannot establish safety.',r'''
分段推力與反力連續~Segment thrust and reaction continuity§中繼站將前後管列分開推進，使單段所需軸力小於整列一次推動的總需求，但每個階段仍需連續反力路徑。前段包含機頭阻力，後段則有自身摩阻；兩者不能直接當成同時疊加在每個接頭的荷載。~Intermediate stations advance leading and trailing pipe sections separately, reducing the force associated with moving the whole string at once. Every stage still needs a continuous reaction path. The leading section includes head resistance while the rear has its own friction; these are not simultaneous loads at every joint.§frontDemand=120 m*8 kN/m+400 kN=1360 kN; rearFriction=180 m*8 kN/m=1440 kN§按行程階段畫出前後管列與後座反力，對照荷重紀錄~Map front and rear pipes and thrust-wall reactions by stroke stage against load records§反力路徑未閉合使後段滑退，前段位移被錯當有效進尺~An incomplete reaction path lets rear pipes retreat and apparent front displacement is mistaken for useful progress§中繼站能推進前段而完全不需要後方提供反力~An intermediate station advances front pipes without any reaction from behind
多缸合力與偏心檢核~Multi-cylinder resultant and eccentricity§中繼站沿環布置多個缸，合力大小與作用位置都取決於各缸實際輸出。共同油壓不保證相同有效力，摩擦、行程止點及失效缸會改變分配；應以各缸位置與荷重重建軸力及力矩。~Cylinders around an intermediate station determine both resultant magnitude and position. Shared hydraulic pressure does not ensure equal effective force because friction, stroke limits and failed cylinders alter distribution. Reconstruct axial force and moment from individual cylinder positions and loads rather than pressure alone.§idealResultant=8*20 MPa*0.010 m2=1.60 MN; sevenCylinders=1.40 MN§比對各缸有效面積、行程及環向荷重分布~Compare effective cylinder area, stroke and circumferential load distribution§一缸卡滯使合力偏心，即使總壓力正常仍壓傷管端~A seized cylinder shifts the resultant and damages the pipe end despite normal total pressure§共用同一油壓就保證所有千斤頂有效推力相同~A shared hydraulic pressure guarantees equal effective thrust from all cylinders
停機黏著與再啟動荷載~Stoppage adhesion and restart loading§停機後潤滑狀態、土體固結和接觸黏著可能改變，使再啟動需求大於移動時摩阻。假想倍率只比較敏感度，不可當作通用再啟動係數；中繼站位置及管節接觸需要對應停機歷程檢查。~Stoppages change lubrication, consolidation and contact adhesion, potentially increasing breakaway demand above moving resistance. An assumed multiplier illustrates sensitivity rather than a universal restart factor. Evaluate station location and joint contact against the actual stoppage history and observed force response.§assumedRestart=1.5*600 kN=900 kN versus 600 kN moving resistance§比較不同停機時長後的推力峰值與持續滑移荷重~Compare peak restart and sustained sliding loads after different stoppage durations§把移動摩阻當啟動需求，停機後接頭瞬間局部超載~Using moving friction as restart demand permits localized joint overload after a stoppage§頂進中量到的摩阻一定等於長時間停機後的啟動阻力~Measured moving friction always equals breakaway resistance after a long stoppage
行程餘量與幾何相容~Stroke reserve and geometric compatibility§中繼站伸縮需與管列彈性縮短、間隙閉合及後段跟進相容，行程餘量不能只由名義缸長判斷。位移可能分配到多個接頭，量測基準若混用管內外位置會產生假餘量；極限位置也不是一般作業目標。~Station travel must accommodate pipe compression, gap closure and trailing advance; nominal cylinder length alone does not establish reserve. Movement spreads across joints, while mixed internal and external datums create false reserve. A mechanical travel limit is not an ordinary operating target.§remainingStroke=0.52 m-(0.40 m+0.10 m)=0.02 m§核對缸伸長、接頭開度與管列前後獨立位移~Check cylinder extension, joint opening and independent front and rear pipeline movement§忽略管列縮短使計算餘量為正，但實際缸已到行程邊界~Ignoring pipe compression predicts positive reserve while a cylinder reaches its travel boundary§名義油缸行程減去機頭進尺就等於真實可用餘量~Nominal cylinder travel minus machine advance equals the true remaining stroke
管列彈性壓縮與位移差~Pipeline elastic compression and displacement differences§受壓管列會彈性縮短，站體行程不完全等於機頭進尺。均勻軸力模型可分離鋼或混凝土材料變形，但接頭墊材與地層滑移會增加非線性位移；卸載回彈和永久進尺必須分開記錄。~A compressed pipeline shortens elastically, so station travel is not entirely machine progress. A uniform-force model isolates material strain, but packers and soil slip add nonlinear movement. Separate unloading rebound from permanent advance to avoid interpreting stored deformation as productive excavation.§elasticShortening=N*L/(E*A)=2e6 N*100 m/(30e9 Pa*0.40 m2)=0.0167 m§比較載入卸載行程、管列應變與機頭絕對位置~Compare loading and unloading travel, pipe strain and absolute machine position§彈性回彈被計成反向滑移，導致錯誤判讀地層摩阻~Elastic rebound is counted as reverse slip and misinterpreted as soil friction behavior§中繼站油缸每伸長一毫米就代表機頭前進一毫米~Every millimeter of station-cylinder extension means one millimeter of machine advance
推力環局部承壓~Thrust-ring local bearing§推力環將離散缸力散布到管端，環的彎曲剛度和接觸平整度決定分配範圍。單缸力除有效接觸面可檢查局部量級，不能以全環面積沖淡峰值；接觸邊緣與管端劈裂仍需結構分析。~A thrust ring distributes discrete cylinder forces into pipe ends, with bending stiffness and flatness controlling the spread. Dividing one cylinder force by its effective footprint checks local scale. Averaging over the entire ring conceals peaks; edge contact and pipe-end splitting need structural assessment.§localBearing=200 kN/0.025 m2=8000 kPa=8 MPa§對照推力環平整度、接觸壓痕及管端環向裂縫~Compare ring flatness, contact impressions and circumferential pipe-end cracks§環變形使單缸力集中到窄邊，平均全環壓力仍顯示很低~Ring distortion focuses one cylinder onto a narrow edge while full-ring mean pressure remains low§推力環存在就能保證所有管端壓力完全均勻~The presence of a thrust ring guarantees perfectly uniform pipe-end pressure
曲線管列與徑向作用~Curved pipe strings and radial action§在曲線中相鄰軸力方向不同，合成後產生徑向作用並增加導向和地層接觸需求。對稱小角模型只給某節點的向量合力，不能替代整條曲線摩阻；角度應用一致單位並對應實際接頭轉角。~Adjacent axial forces change direction along a curve, producing radial action and additional guidance or ground contact demand. A symmetric angle model gives the vector resultant at one node, not the entire curved-drive friction. Use consistent angular units tied to actual joint rotation.§radialResultant=2*N*sin(theta/2)=2*1000 kN*sin(2 degrees/2)=34.90 kN§比較曲線接頭角度、側向接觸與導向偏差~Compare curved-joint angles, lateral contact and guidance deviation§軸力方向改變被忽略，使側壁接觸壓力與摩阻被低估~Ignoring changing force direction understates lateral contact pressure and friction§曲線內只要軸向推力相同就不會增加任何側向作用~Equal axial thrust in a curve produces no additional lateral action
伸縮套筒與水密邊界~Telescopic sleeves and watertight boundaries§中繼站伸縮套筒需在相對移動中保持水密，密封方向和有效壓力面積取決於構造。水壓合力只是作用之一，偏心、砂粒與刮傷可能先破壞密封；靜態水密合格不能代表全行程循環後仍無損傷。~Telescopic sleeves maintain tightness during relative motion, with seal orientation and effective pressure area defined by detail. Water-pressure force is only one action; eccentricity, grit and scratches can defeat sealing first. Passing a static test does not establish integrity after full cyclic travel.§waterResultant=150 kPa*0.20 m2=30 kN§比較套筒間隙、全行程密封檢查與滲水時序~Compare sleeve clearance, full-travel seal inspections and leakage timing§砂粒刮傷在伸縮後形成漏水通道，靜止試驗未曾顯現~Grit scoring opens a leakage path after movement that was absent during a stationary test§中繼站靜止不漏水就證明伸縮過程一定完全水密~No leakage at rest proves the station remains watertight throughout movement
剛度變化與異常辨識~Stiffness changes and anomaly diagnosis§荷重位移斜率可描述特定區段的表觀剛度，卻混合缸、環、墊材、管列與土體的反應。斜率突變可能是接觸閉合、滑移或儀器基準變動，不能只憑曲線判定一個零件損壞；需與分部位移聯合解讀。~A load-displacement slope describes apparent stiffness over an interval but combines cylinders, rings, packers, pipes and soil. A change may reflect contact closure, slip or datum movement rather than a single damaged component. Interpret it with component displacement measurements to identify the responsible mechanism.§secantStiffness=(1200 kN-1000 kN)/(4 mm-2 mm)=100 kN/mm§將總行程分解為缸、接頭及管列位移並比較斜率~Separate overall travel into cylinder, joint and pipe movements and compare slopes§測點基座鬆動造成假剛度下降，被誤判管節破壞~A loose sensor base creates apparent stiffness loss mistaken for pipe failure§荷重位移斜率下降就唯一證明混凝土管節已破裂~A reduced load-displacement slope uniquely proves the concrete pipe has fractured
站體閉合與通水淨空~Station closure and hydraulic clearance§施工完成後中繼站狀態必須符合永久管線要求，局部凸起、未閉合間隙與拆件遺留會影響水力和維護通道。圓截面面積比只能估幾何縮減，流量還取決於坡度、粗糙與局部損失；影像應與最後配置核對。~After construction the station must meet permanent-pipeline requirements; protrusions, unclosed gaps and leftover fittings affect flow and maintenance access. Circular area ratio estimates geometric restriction only, while capacity also depends on slope, roughness and local losses. Match inspection images to the final configuration.§clearAreaRatio=(1.42 m/1.50 m)^2=0.8962=89.6 percent§核對最終閉合尺寸、內視影像與拆件交接清單~Reconcile final closure dimensions, internal images and removed-equipment records§臨時構件殘留形成局部阻塞，施工推進完成卻不符永久功能~Remaining temporary fittings restrict flow despite completed construction advance§頂進任務完成就代表中繼站永久通水功能必定合格~Completion of jacking guarantees the permanent hydraulic function of every station
''')

add('b174','定向鑽掘的姿態積分、誤差來源與障礙淨距~Directional-drilling attitude integration, error sources and obstacle clearance','導向幾何與磁場算例為小偏差或單段簡化，並非鑽進路徑指令；定位不確定度、管徑及設施尺寸需另併入。~Guidance geometry and magnetic examples simplify small errors or single segments and are not drilling commands; positioning uncertainty, pipe diameter and utility dimensions require separate inclusion.','方向誤差由 0.1 增至 0.2 度，在 100 m 直段上橫向差約由 0.175 增至 0.349 m；系統誤差不能靠增加相同來源讀值消除。~Increasing heading error from 0.1 to 0.2 degree raises lateral offset over a 100 m straight segment from about 0.175 to 0.349 m; repeating the same biased source does not remove systematic error.',r'''
鑽桿長度與垂向投影~Rod length and vertical projection§鑽進長度沿實際路徑量取，垂向變化由傾角投影決定而非直接等於桿長。分段積分需保留角度正負與參考方向，彎曲段還需考慮角度在桿內的變化；一個末端傾角不能代表整段平均姿態。~Drilled length follows the actual path, while vertical change comes from inclination projection rather than rod length itself. Segment integration requires signed angles and reference direction, with curvature changing attitude within a rod. One endpoint inclination cannot automatically represent the segment-average attitude.§verticalChange=L*sin(inclination)=3 m*sin(5 degrees)=0.2615 m§核對桿長紀錄、傾角符號與獨立高程閉合~Check rod-length records, inclination signs and independent elevation closure§把向下傾角符號反用，路徑深度隨進尺愈算愈錯~Reversing the sign of downward inclination progressively corrupts calculated depth§鑽桿末端傾角一定等於整根鑽桿的平均傾角~The rod-end inclination always equals the mean inclination of the whole rod
方位誤差與橫向漂移~Heading error and lateral drift§微小方位偏差沿距離累積成顯著橫向漂移，固定偏差與隨機噪聲的統計行為不同。直線投影可估單一偏差的量級，真正路線需要逐段姿態積分；不能把多次讀值平均當成對磁北或控制網的獨立校核。~Small heading bias accumulates into substantial lateral drift, unlike zero-mean random noise. Straight projection estimates one fixed-bias effect, while real routes require segmentwise attitude integration. Averaging repeated readings does not independently verify the magnetic reference or survey control network.§lateralOffset=100 m*tan(0.1 degrees)=0.1745 m§比較重複方位讀值與獨立測量控制的方向差~Compare repeated headings with independently surveyed control directions§固定方位偏差被當隨機誤差平均，長距離後仍偏離走廊~A fixed heading bias is treated as random noise and the long route still leaves its corridor§同一導向儀讀很多次就能消除所有系統性方位偏差~Many readings from one guidance instrument eliminate every systematic heading bias
曲率半徑與角度單位~Curvature radius and angular units§相鄰姿態角差與弧長決定局部曲率，但角度需轉成弧度才可直接使用半徑關係。鑽具和成品管各有不同彎曲限制，短距姿態噪聲會製造假小半徑；路徑平滑不能刪除真實局部折角的證據。~Local curvature relates arc length to attitude change, with radians required in the radius relation. Drill string and product pipe have different bending constraints, and short-baseline attitude noise can create falsely tight curvature. Smoothing the path must not erase evidence of a real localized dogleg.§radius=arcLength/dTheta=3 m/(0.5*pi/180 rad)=343.8 m§比對相鄰姿態、測距及獨立管材彎曲要求~Compare adjacent attitudes and distances with separately established pipe-bending requirements§把度數直接當弧度使半徑低估數十倍，導致錯誤判讀~Using degrees directly as radians understates radius by a large factor and distorts interpretation§用弧長除角度時不需要區分度數與弧度~Dividing arc length by angle never requires distinguishing degrees from radians
工具面與地層轉向反應~Toolface and ground steering response§工具面方向設定與實際軌跡轉向之間受地層、鑽頭和桿件彈性影響，並非固定一比一。觀察到的轉向增益僅適用該段與該工況，交替地層可能改變幅度和延遲；應先識別回應再談模型是否可信。~Toolface orientation does not translate one-to-one into route turning because ground, bit and rod elasticity intervene. Observed steering gain belongs to the specific segment and state; changing layers alter magnitude and delay. Identify the response before treating a steering model as transferable.§observedGain=actualTurn/requestedTurn=0.30 degree/0.50 degree=0.60§對照工具面紀錄、實測姿態變化與地層轉換里程~Compare toolface records and measured attitude changes against geological transitions§沿用前一土層增益造成過度修正，曲率在界面集中~Reusing the previous layer gain overcorrects the route and concentrates curvature at the interface§工具面偏轉角度永遠等於成孔路徑的實際轉向角~Toolface deflection always equals the actual turning angle of the bore
磁場干擾與方位可信度~Magnetic interference and heading confidence§磁導向依賴地磁向量，埋設鋼材、電流及鄰近設施會改變局部場。簡單橫向擾動模型可顯示方位敏感度，但傾角補償與三維磁異常需另評估；總磁場強度接近正常也不能保證方向不偏。~Magnetic guidance depends on the field vector, disturbed by buried steel, electrical currents and nearby structures. A simple transverse perturbation illustrates heading sensitivity, while tilt compensation and three-dimensional anomalies require separate assessment. A near-normal field magnitude does not prove an unbiased field direction.§headingBias=atan(Btransverse/Breference)=atan(0.5 uT/20 uT)=1.432 degrees§比較三軸磁場、設備位置與非磁性導向或測量證據~Compare three-axis magnetic fields and equipment positions with nonmagnetic guidance or survey evidence§局部鋼材扭轉磁場方向，總場近正常卻方位已偏移~Local steel rotates the field while near-normal magnitude conceals heading bias§總磁場強度正常就能保證磁導向的方位完全準確~Normal total magnetic intensity guarantees completely accurate magnetic heading
陀螺漂移與時間校核~Gyro drift and time checks§陀螺可避免部分磁干擾，但零偏會隨積分時間累積，溫度和振動又可能改變偏差。恆定漂移假設適合看時間敏感度，不保證實際誤差線性；獨立起始方位與週期校核需連到每段資料的時間戳。~A gyro avoids some magnetic disturbance, but bias accumulates with integration time and can vary with temperature and vibration. Constant drift illustrates time sensitivity without guaranteeing linear real error. Independent initial heading and periodic checks must be linked to each segment timestamp.§angleDrift=0.02 degree/h*0.5 h=0.010 degree; finalAngleProjection=200 m*tan(0.010 degree)=0.0349 m assuming the final angle applies over the entire length; not a time-integrated guidance path error§對照陀螺溫度、時間戳與獨立方位閉合差~Compare gyro temperature and timestamps with independent heading-closure error§重啟後沿用舊零偏，磁場雖無影響仍產生路線漂移~Reusing an old bias after restart creates route drift despite freedom from magnetic interference§陀螺不受磁場影響就代表永遠不會產生方位誤差~A gyro immune to magnetic interference never develops heading error
設施淨距與不確定度~Utility clearance and uncertainty§地下設施的中心線位置、外徑和調查精度都影響真正淨距，圖上中心距不是可用安全間隔。不確定度扣減需明示保守或統計規則，還要扣除兩者尺寸；未知設施不能因地圖空白就視為不存在。~True utility clearance depends on centerline location, outside dimensions and survey uncertainty; map center distance is not available separation. State conservative or statistical uncertainty rules and subtract both object dimensions. A blank map does not establish that unknown services are absent from the route.§centerDistance=sqrt((0.30 m)^2+(0.40 m)^2)=0.50 m; afterConservativeUncertainty=0.50-0.10-0.15=0.25 m before subtracting radii§逐一核對設施實測位置、外徑及定位不確定度~Check surveyed utility position, outside diameter and positioning uncertainty individually§只比較中心線距離而漏扣半徑，使實際外表面互相侵入~Comparing centerlines without radii allows actual external surfaces to intersect§圖上的中心距大於零就代表鑽孔與設施一定不接觸~Positive centerline separation on a map guarantees bore and utility do not touch
環空輸送與孔內壓力~Annular transport and bore pressure§環空流速由流量和淨流通面積決定，偏心、岩屑床與非牛頓流變會改變局部速度及壓損。平均流速不能單獨證明孔壁穩定或不會冒漿；導向紀錄需與返流及壓力資料共同解釋地層反應。~Annular velocity follows flow and available area, while eccentricity, cuttings beds and non-Newtonian rheology change local speed and loss. Mean velocity alone proves neither wall stability nor freedom from inadvertent returns. Interpret guidance with return-flow and pressure evidence to understand ground response.§annulusArea=pi*((0.60 m)^2-(0.40 m)^2)/4=0.1571 m2; meanVelocity=0.020 m3/s/0.1571 m2=0.1273 m/s§對照進返流量、環空壓力及地表異常位置~Compare feed and return flow, annular pressure and locations of surface anomalies§岩屑床縮小流路推高局部壓力，但平均環空面積仍被當固定~A cuttings bed restricts flow and raises local pressure while nominal annular area is treated as unchanged§平均環空流速正常就能排除所有冒漿風險~Normal mean annular velocity rules out every inadvertent-return risk
回拖彎曲與軸向應變~Pullback bending and axial strain§成品管沿孔道曲率彎曲，回拖張力再疊加軸向應變，最外纖維可能成為控制位置。小應變線彈性相加需使用一致材料模量，熱塑管的時間與溫度行為不能直接套鋼材；實際孔徑和摩擦仍影響回拖荷載。~The product pipe bends along bore curvature while pullback tension adds axial strain, potentially governing the outer fiber. Small-strain elastic addition requires consistent modulus; thermoplastic time and temperature behavior cannot be replaced by steel assumptions. Actual bore geometry and friction also affect pullback loading.§elasticSteelExample: bendingStrain=D/(2*R)=0.40 m/(2*200 m)=0.001; axialStrain=20 MPa/200000 MPa=0.0001; sum=0.0011§比較成孔曲率、回拖荷重及成品管材溫度性能~Compare bore curvature, pullback load and temperature-dependent product-pipe properties§鋼管模量被錯用於塑膠管，嚴重低估實際軸向變形~Applying steel modulus to plastic pipe substantially understates actual axial deformation§所有管材都能用同一彈性模量估算回拖應變~Every pipe material uses the same elastic modulus for pullback strain
竣工閉合與全線可信度~As-built closure and route confidence§終點閉合誤差是整段測量的一項約束，不能保證中途每個位置正確；相反方向偏差可能在終點互相抵消。全線成果需保留逐桿原始資料、校正和獨立控制，並把位置不確定度沿路徑呈現。~Endpoint closure constrains the survey but does not prove every intermediate position, because opposing errors can cancel at the end. Preserve raw rod-by-rod data, corrections and independent control. Present uncertainty along the route rather than interpreting one endpoint residual as a universal error bound.§endpointResidual=sqrt((0.05 m)^2+(0.03 m)^2+(0.04 m)^2)=0.0707 m§把終點閉合與中途獨立控制點及逐桿資料比對~Compare endpoint closure with intermediate independent control points and rod-by-rod data§中途左右偏差相互抵消，終點漂亮卻曾侵入設施走廊~Opposing intermediate errors cancel at the endpoint despite entering a utility corridor along the route§終點閉合誤差小就能證明中途所有位置都正確~Small endpoint closure error proves every intermediate position is correct
''')

add('b175','沉井下沉平衡、刃腳接觸與封底抗浮~Sinking-caisson equilibrium, cutting-edge contact and base-plug uplift','下沉驅動、土阻與水壓隨施工階段改變；靜力差值不預測下沉速度，抗浮重量比也不是規範安全係數。~Driving weight, soil resistance and water pressure change by stage; static imbalance does not predict sinking speed, and a weight-to-uplift ratio is not a code safety factor.','假設側摩阻由 3500 降至 2500 kN，其餘力不變，淨向下力由 500 增至 1500 kN；三倍差值不能推成三倍下沉速度。~If assumed skin resistance falls from 3500 to 2500 kN with other forces unchanged, net downward force rises from 500 to 1500 kN; tripling imbalance does not imply triple sinking speed.',r'''
下沉驅動與力系平衡~Sinking drive and force equilibrium§沉井自重與附加荷載提供下沉作用，浮力、側摩阻與刃腳反力則抵抗移動。各項會隨水位、接觸和土體擾動改變，靜態差值只表示假想瞬間的不平衡；突然卸阻時需要考慮動態和可控性，不能由力差直接決定施工動作。~Caisson weight and surcharge drive sinking against buoyancy, skin friction and cutting-edge resistance. Water levels, contact and disturbed soil change these terms. A static difference describes a hypothetical instant, while sudden resistance loss involves dynamics and controllability; imbalance alone cannot prescribe field action.§netDownward=8000 kN-3000 kN-3500 kN-1000 kN=500 kN§按同一時刻比對重量、水位、位移及周邊接觸證據~Compare weight, water levels, movement and perimeter-contact evidence at a shared time§側摩阻突然降低使原本靜止井體突沉，平均平衡計算未捕捉動態~Sudden skin-resistance loss triggers rapid sinking that an average equilibrium calculation misses§下沉淨力為正就能唯一決定沉井的下沉速度~Positive downward imbalance uniquely determines the caisson sinking velocity
側摩阻與埋深累積~Skin resistance and embedded depth§井壁與地層摩阻沿周邊和深度分布，不同土層、潤滑和接觸間隙使剪應力非均勻。平均值模型可顯示埋深敏感度，但上下段可能在不同時刻動員；停沉後黏著恢復也會改變再次移動所需力。~Wall friction distributes around the perimeter and depth, varying with layers, lubrication and gaps. A mean-stress model shows depth sensitivity, but upper and lower sections mobilize at different times. Adhesion recovered during a pause can further change the force needed to resume movement.§skinResistance=tau*pi*D*depth=15 kPa*pi*10 m*20 m=9425 kN§將土層分段、井壁接觸與停沉前後荷重位移對照~Compare layer intervals and wall contact with load-displacement before and after stoppages§以淺層平均摩阻推估全深，漏掉高黏著層造成懸掛~Extrapolating shallow mean friction misses a high-adhesion layer that hangs up the caisson§沉井每增加一米深度都一定增加相同大小的摩阻~Every added meter of sinking always adds the same skin resistance
刃腳環帶與局部支承~Cutting-edge annulus and local support§刃腳將井體荷載傳到下方土體，理想環帶面積不等於實際均勻接觸。地層軟硬差、刃角幾何和局部掏空會使壓力集中，還可能引起井壁彎曲；平均承壓只用於檢查量級，不能定義局部挖土範圍。~The cutting edge transfers load into underlying soil, but its geometric annulus is not necessarily uniformly engaged. Contrasting strata, edge geometry and local voids concentrate pressure and can bend the wall. Mean bearing checks scale only and cannot define a field excavation pattern.§annulusArea=pi*((10 m)^2-(9 m)^2)/4=14.92 m2; meanBearing=6000 kN/14.92 m2=402.1 kPa§比較刃腳高程、接觸分布與井壁環向應變~Compare cutting-edge elevations, contact distribution and circumferential wall strain§局部硬層形成支點使井體傾斜，整圈平均承壓仍不異常~A local hard layer forms a pivot and tilts the caisson despite an unremarkable mean bearing stress§刃腳平均承壓均勻就代表每個位置實際接觸均勻~Uniform assumed mean bearing proves uniform actual contact at every cutting-edge point
井體傾斜與共同基準~Caisson tilt and shared survey datum§井體傾斜由對向高差與水平基線定義，單一側點下沉不能區分整體沉降與轉動。環向多點可檢查是否近似剛體，井壁彎曲或測點鬆動會破壞此假設；量測系統須與影響區外穩定基準連結。~Tilt follows differential elevation over a horizontal baseline, while one sinking point cannot separate translation from rotation. Circumferential points test the rigid-body assumption, which wall bending or loose targets can invalidate. Tie measurements to stable reference points outside the influence zone.§tilt=oppositeLevelDifference/diameter=0.020 m/10 m=0.002 rad§以環向多點高程、井壁垂直度與外部基準閉合比對~Compare perimeter elevations, wall verticality and external-datum closure§共同基準點沉陷讓井體傾斜被低估，修正判斷方向錯誤~Settlement of a shared benchmark understates tilt and misdirects correction interpretation§量一側井口高程就能完整決定整座沉井傾斜~One rim elevation fully determines the tilt of the whole caisson
井底滲流與有效應力~Base seepage and effective stress§井內外水頭差沿井底滲流路徑產生梯度，向上滲流降低土體有效應力。平均路徑模型不能代表刃腳附近局部峰值，黏土不排水隆起也不是砂土臨界梯度問題；先辨識土類、方向和破壞機制再比較數值。~Head difference drives base seepage, and upward flow reduces effective stress. An average path misses local gradients near the cutting edge; undrained clay heave is distinct from granular critical-gradient behavior. Identify soil type, flow direction and mechanism before interpreting numerical comparisons.§upwardGradient=8 m/5 m=1.60; idealGranularCritical=(Gs-1)/(1+e)=(2.65-1)/(1+0.65)=1.00§對照內外水頭、底部孔壓及出水含砂變化~Compare internal and external head, base pore pressure and sand content in seepage§向上水力梯度集中於短路徑，出砂與土體鬆動逐步發展~Upward gradients concentrate along a short path and progressively mobilize sand and loosen soil§任何土層都能用同一砂土臨界梯度判定井底穩定~One granular critical gradient determines base stability in every soil type
降水固結與鄰近沉陷~Dewatering consolidation and neighboring settlement§井周降水降低孔壓並提高有效應力，可能使可壓縮層固結而影響鄰近設施。線性壓縮模型只適合指定應力範圍和一維假設，實際沉陷還取決於分層、時間與降水範圍；井體本身位移不能代替周邊監測。~Dewatering reduces pore pressure and increases effective stress, potentially consolidating compressible layers beneath neighboring assets. A linear model assumes a specified stress interval and one-dimensional response. Layering, time and drawdown extent control real settlement; caisson movement cannot substitute for surrounding monitoring.§settlement=mv*dSigma*H=0.0001 m2/kN*100 kPa*10 m=0.10 m§將周邊水位、分層壓縮及建物沉陷按時間對齊~Align surrounding water levels, layer compression and building settlement in time§只監測井體穩定而忽略遠處降水沉陷，鄰房持續變形~Monitoring only caisson stability misses remote drawdown settlement and ongoing building deformation§沉井沒有移動就證明周圍地層與建築都不會沉陷~An unmoving caisson proves surrounding ground and buildings cannot settle
位移速率與突沉辨識~Movement rate and sudden-sinking detection§沉井移動速率需依時間解析度判讀，長時段平均會掩蓋短暫突沉。速率跳變可能來自土阻崩落，也可能是感測器或時鐘異常；應使用同步獨立資料確認，而不是由累積進尺推定整段平順。~Movement rate depends on time resolution, and long averages can hide brief rapid sinking. A rate jump may reflect resistance collapse or sensor and clock error. Confirm it with synchronized independent data rather than inferring smooth motion from total progress over the reporting interval.§meanRate=0.12 m/0.50 h=0.24 m/h; shortEvent=0.10 m/(1/60 h)=6.0 m/h§比較高頻位移、時鐘同步與獨立井口測量~Compare high-frequency movement, clock synchronization and independent rim surveys§一分鐘突沉被半小時平均稀釋，報表看似平順~A one-minute sinking event is diluted by a half-hour average and appears smooth in reports§半小時平均速度低就能排除期間任何突沉事件~A low half-hour average speed rules out every rapid-sinking event within it
封底自重與水壓作用~Base-plug weight and water-pressure action§封底承受向上水壓並把作用傳到井壁或其他核定抗浮系統，自重通常只是抵抗項之一。水下施工階段與排水後壓差不同，不能只確認混凝土厚度就判斷可轉換狀態；黏結、剪力傳遞與齡期強度另需驗證。~The base plug transfers uplift to the walls or another approved resisting system, with self-weight only one resistance component. Differential pressure changes between underwater and dewatered stages. Thickness alone cannot justify a stage change; bond, shear transfer and age-dependent strength need separate evidence.§A=pi*(10 m)^2/4=78.54 m2; plugWeight=24 kN/m3*2 m*A=3770 kN; uplift=9.81 kN/m3*10 m*A=7705 kN§對照封底厚度、齡期、井壁接觸及分階段水頭~Compare plug thickness, age, wall contact and stage-specific head§封底自重不足卻漏計或未證實壁面傳力，水壓使封底抬升~Insufficient plug weight combined with unverified wall transfer permits uplift displacement§封底混凝土已硬化就代表任何排水水頭都能承受~Hardened base concrete can sustain any dewatering head without further verification
接縫水密與相對位移~Joint tightness and relative movement§井壁節段與封底交界可能在下沉、固結和溫度變化時產生相對位移，止水材料需要對應開度與剪切。幾何應變只是形變指標，不能代替產品的循環、黏結或老化試驗；漏點位置還可能是水沿界面遷移後的出口。~Wall segments and base interfaces move during sinking, consolidation and temperature changes, requiring seals suited to opening and shear. Geometric strain is a deformation indicator, not a substitute for cyclic, bond or aging tests. A visible leak may be an outlet after migration along an interface.§nominalSealStrain=jointOpening/sealGauge=2 mm/20 mm=0.10=10 percent§比較接縫開度、剪位移及滲水位置的時間關係~Compare the timing of joint opening, shear movement and leakage locations§只檢查張開而漏掉剪切損傷，止水帶外觀完整仍滲漏~Checking only opening misses shear damage and leakage despite an intact-looking waterstop§止水帶外觀完整就一定能承受所有接縫剪位移~An intact-looking waterstop withstands every possible joint shear movement
永久抗浮與階段交接~Permanent uplift resistance and stage handover§沉井作為永久豎井後，抗浮依賴最終重量、結構連接及設計水位，施工臨時壓重不能自動列為永久抵抗。重量與浮力比只是未分項平衡，規範組合、耐久和連接強度另行要求；交接需明確哪些抵抗已實際形成。~As a permanent shaft, uplift resistance depends on final weight, structural connections and design water level. Temporary ballast is not automatically permanent resistance. A raw weight-to-buoyancy ratio omits code combinations, durability and connection checks; handover must identify which resisting mechanisms are actually established.§buoyancy=9.81 kN/m3*1000 m3=9810 kN; rawWeightRatio=12000 kN/9810 kN=1.223§逐項確認永久重量、連接形成及設計水位版本~Verify permanent weight, established connections and the design-water-level version item by item§移除臨時壓重卻沿用舊抗浮計算，永久狀態抵抗不足~Removing temporary ballast while retaining the old uplift calculation overstates permanent resistance§施工時重量浮力比大於一就代表永久抗浮必定合格~A construction-stage weight ratio above one guarantees permanent uplift compliance
''')
